Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Kosta File: Outlook / Word / Excel / PowerPoint on the web (public Microsoft pages) open the add-in
; from tickets.kostalegal.com, which inside the office resolves to a private address (192.168.230.222).
; Chrome / Edge "Local Network Access" blocks that (net::ERR_BLOCKED_BY_LOCAL_NETWORK_ACCESS_CHECKS).
; These policies exempt the Microsoft 365 pages that host the add-in. Apply via GPO / Intune or
; import on a PC as administrator, then restart the browser and check chrome://policy / edge://policy.
; Temporary measure until tickets.kostalegal.com is reachable on its public address.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://outlook.office.com"
"2"="https://outlook.office365.com"
"3"="https://outlook.cloud.microsoft"
"4"="https://[*.]officeapps.live.com"
"5"="https://[*.]sharepoint.com"
"6"="https://[*.]cloud.microsoft"
"7"="https://[*.]office.com"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://outlook.office.com"
"2"="https://outlook.office365.com"
"3"="https://outlook.cloud.microsoft"
"4"="https://[*.]officeapps.live.com"
"5"="https://[*.]sharepoint.com"
"6"="https://[*.]cloud.microsoft"
"7"="https://[*.]office.com"
